timeline.body:
Note that `System.getSecurityManager` is currently constant folded to return `null`. So this is dead code. Maybe change it to 
```
if (System.getSecurityManager() != null) {
  throw VMError.shouldNotReachHere("Needs to be implemented when SecurityManager is supported");
}
```
so that it is explicit?

